  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Connected Atlas",
    "overview": "Navy corridor fields connect white inspection sheets, fine route geometry and orange selections. The system makes relationships between projects, locations, imagery, measured profiles and deliverables visible. Public pages use geometric display type; private workspaces keep conventional forms, tabs, lists and file tables.\n\nOperational surfaces are restrained and readable, with role-specific next actions and explicit availability. Preserve the official Powertek identity and its logo proportions. This records the shipped code: `app/home.css` and then `app/experience.css` take precedence over earlier styles imported by `app/layout.tsx`.",
